{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "draft.example" : {
      "comment" : "Part of the prompt sent to the model (not shown in the interface): introduces an answer from Ask Atd, sent after the person's sentence, as an example of the result the drafted command should give",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The result I want looks like this (the details differ each time):"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我想要的结果像这样（具体内容每次不同）："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "prompt.draft" : {
      "comment" : "Part of the prompt sent to the model (not shown in the interface): system prompt that drafts a command from one sentence as JSON",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn the person's sentence into a command for Atd. A command reads the text in the field they are typing in, a message they copied, or what they share from another app, or it runs with no input. It writes its result into the field or shows it on a card. Reply with only a JSON object and nothing else, with these keys:\nname: a short name (at most 6 Chinese characters or 3 English words)\nsymbol: an SF Symbols name for it\ntint: one of red, orange, yellow, green, mint, teal, cyan, blue, indigo, purple, pink, brown, gray\ninstructions: what the model is asked to do each time the command runs\ninput: \"text\" (the text in the field), \"copied\" (a copied message), \"shared\" (what is shared from another app: a message, a page or a document) or \"none\" (no input)\noutput: \"replace\" (replace the text it read), \"insert\" (insert at the cursor) or \"card\" (show the result on a card)\ncard: with output \"card\", what the card holds: \"text\" (text to read), \"notes\" (notes and to-dos) or \"event\" (one calendar event to add)\nreview: true to preview the result before it is written\noptions: up to 3 choices made when it runs, each {\"label\" : …, \"choices\" : [2 to 4 short values], \"value\" : the default}\nChoose \"replace\" or \"insert\" when the result is text to send or keep writing, and \"card\" when it is something to read or act on.\nWrite the name, instructions, labels and choices in the language of the sentence."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把用户的一句话变成 Atd 的一条指令。指令读取正在输入的输入框里的文字、用户拷贝的一条消息，或者从别的 App 分享过来的内容，也可以不需要输入；结果写回输入框，或者显示在卡片上。只回复一个 JSON 对象，不要别的文字，包含这些键：\nname：简短的名字（中文不超过 6 个字，英文不超过 3 个词）\nsymbol：一个 SF Symbols 图标名\ntint：red、orange、yellow、green、mint、teal、cyan、blue、indigo、purple、pink、brown、gray 之一\ninstructions：每次运行时对模型的要求\ninput：\"text\"（输入框里的文字）、\"copied\"（拷贝的消息）、\"shared\"（从别的 App 分享过来的内容：消息、网页或文档）或 \"none\"（不需要输入）\noutput：\"replace\"（替换读到的文字）、\"insert\"（插入到光标处）或 \"card\"（把结果显示在卡片上）\ncard：output 是 \"card\" 时卡片上是什么：\"text\"（一段要看的文字）、\"notes\"（笔记和待办）或 \"event\"（一个要加到日历的日程）\nreview：true 表示写回前先预览\noptions：最多 3 个运行时可选的选项，每个是 {\"label\" : …, \"choices\" : [2 到 4 个简短的值], \"value\" : 默认值}\n结果是要发出去或接着写的文字时选 \"replace\" 或 \"insert\"，是要看的内容或要办的事时选 \"card\"。\n名字、要求、选项的标签和取值用这句话的语言写。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}
